extends /specs/products/pericles/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    .source_info
        markdown
            p styles changed based on <a href='https://jira.atypon.com/browse/LIT-192164' target="_blank">`LIT-192164`</a>

    section.source_section
        h2 Blockquotes


        h3 default
        .source_example
            blockquote
                | Concussions have become a critical public health issue, resulting in a substantial increase in research. As a clinician searching for the most up-to-date information, Concussion can serve as the go-to journal.

        h3 Quote
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `quote` class.
        .source_example
            blockquote.quote
                | Concussions have become a critical public health issue, resulting in a substantial increase in research. As a clinician searching for the most up-to-date information, Concussion can serve as the go-to journal.

        h3 Poetry
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `poetry` class.
        .source_example
            blockquote.poetry
                ul.custom.rlist
                    li
                        p.line tf09blkfxd0006 I cannot rest from travel: I will drink
                    li
                        p.line Life to the lees: All times I have enjoy'd
                    li
                        p.line Greatly, have suffer'd greatly, both with those
                    li
                        p.line I am part of all that I have met.

    section.source_section
        h2 blockFixed
        h3 default
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `block-box` class.
        .source_example
            div.block-box
                p tf09blkfxd0011 Here is simple boxed text.



        h3 Dialogue
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `block-box dialogue` class.
        .source_example
            .block-box.dialogue
                h3.block__title Talkin' the Talk
                p
                .list-paired(id='')
                    dl
                        dt
                            li Viktor tf09blkfxd0004a
                        dd
                            li
                                b Privyet Marina, chto novogo? Kuda vy propali?
                        dt
                            li Marina
                        dd
                            li
                                b
                                    | Privyet, Viktor! Ya nyeskol'ko myesyatsyev otdykhala, a potom nachala rabotat' v shkloyle.




    | #{''}